\section{Outlaw epistemologies}

\par
What kinds of truth do we gather from country music? One potential truth that we can gather from country music is of the ‘epistemic machinations of settler colonialism’.
\par
\begin{quotation}

\par
“Finally, by focusing on engagements with country music that support a broader understanding of the world and its possibilities, we might come to understand how country music inflects the epistemic machinations of settler colonialism.2” (Meissner and Huebner, 2022, p. 215)
\par
\end{quotation}

